## Generated code

The generated C# APIs reference standard packages resolved at generation time
through the bridge's registry (EF Core, Npgsql, JWT, Swashbuckle, and others).
These are pulled by the generated project itself and are subject to their own
licences; the bridge declares the resolved versions in
`registry_packages`.

## Tooling

The compliance suite (`compliance-suite/suite.js`) runs under the k6 load
testing tool, licensed under AGPL-3.0. k6 is a developer tool and is not
distributed with DomainCraft.
